{"unit_id":"Ackerman0__Dsh-Prompt-Enhancement#caveat-data","repo":"Ackerman0/Dsh-Prompt-Enhancement","commit":"34ec6a27ded58711e795d25254ddcbd25bc49274","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhance 使用前须知：联网回退会访问 jsDelivr 和 GitHub API 获取公共提示词模板与仓库信息；源码中这些请求未附带用户草稿。模型改写通过 DSH 当前模型路由处理输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:21-26","lib/client.js:1327-1349"]}
